{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-d50d59c1ca77","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-d50d59c1ca77","name":"话梅煮毛豆","category":"vegetable_dish","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/vegetable_dish/%E8%AF%9D%E6%A2%85%E7%85%AE%E6%AF%9B%E8%B1%86/%E8%AF%9D%E6%A2%85%E7%85%AE%E6%AF%9B%E8%B1%86.md","blob_sha":"d5af011210667cac3ed2107c5e6e5432ce3b901c","details":{"introduction":"话梅煮毛豆是一道酸甜开胃的家常小菜，口感清爽软糯，带有梅子的自然果香。毛豆富含植物蛋白和膳食纤维，有助于补充能量、促进消化。做法非常简单，新手也能轻松上手，全程只需 35 到 45 分钟即可完成。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"* 毛豆\n* 话梅\n* 食用盐"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"每份：\n\n* 毛豆 300 g\n* 话梅 6 颗\n* 食用盐 2 g"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 清水加入食用盐，毛豆浸泡 15 分钟\n2. 加入开水，倒入毛豆、话梅，水煮 20-30 分钟\n3. 起锅开吃"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"unknown","basis":null,"serving_g":null,"scope":null,"per_100g":{"energy_kcal":null,"protein_g":null,"carbohydrate_g":null,"fat_g":null},"source":null},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"family-d50d59c1ca77-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-d50d59c1ca77","recipe_blob_sha":"d5af011210667cac3ed2107c5e6e5432ce3b901c","version":"1","data_version":"63486da6aadf9c50","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","estimate_confidence":"low","final_weight":{"grams":500,"method":"household_recipe_assumption","basis":"standard_recipe_assumption","is_measured":false,"servings":{"min":2,"max":3},"evidence":"项目按2–3人家庭份明确设定成品500g，非实测或USDA出成率；原料与成品重分别保存。"},"retention_correction":"not_applied","basis":"per_100g","completeness":"complete","scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：去荚毛豆400g、白砂糖12g、食盐3g、白醋8g、饮用水200g；整份约500g。去荚毛豆400g，话梅风味按最终留在豆上的糖12g醋8g盐3g估量，不用整锅煮汁；话梅果肉不食，其微量浸出营养忽略，酸味以白醋作明确代理。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-d50d59c1ca77","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"simmer","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":true,"sauce